  "goodToKnow": "Trotzig means defiant, stubborn or sulky: ein trotziges Kind, trotzig schweigen. Toddlers go through the Trotzphase (terrible twos). Der Trotz is defiance: aus Trotz (out of spite), allen Widerständen zum Trotz (despite all resistance); the preposition trotz (despite) comes from it. Synonyms: bockig, stur, widerspenstig. The opposite is brav."
